  ultimateText: "N\xE9m M\xF3c: k\xE9o qu\xE1i b\u1EAFn xa v\u1EC1 s\xE1t m\xECnh
    + cho\xE1ng, r\u1ED3i Cu\u1ED3ng N\u1ED9 V\u0128NH VI\u1EC4N t\u1EDBi khi g\u1EE5c
    \u2014 hai x\xEDch d\xE0i, t\u0103ng c\xF4ng/t\u1ED1c \u0111\xE1nh, gi\u1EA3m
    s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng nh\u1EADn, h\xFAt m\xE1u."
  passiveText: "C\xE1i Ng\u1EE5c: gi\u1EEF t\u1ED1i \u0111a 4 qu\xE1i; qu\xE1i \u0111ang
    b\u1ECB gi\u1EEF nh\u1EADn +20% s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng t\u1EEB m\u1ECDi ngu\u1ED3n."
  minorText: "Qu\xE9t X\xEDch: quay x\xEDch quanh m\xECnh, s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng
    th\u1EA5p + tr\xF3i (Cu\u1ED3ng N\u1ED9: L\u1ED1c X\xEDch 360\xB0)."
  secondMinorText: "Gi\u1EADt X\xEDch: \u0111ang gi\u1EEF t\u1EEB 2 qu\xE1i th\xEC
    gi\u1EADt m\u1EA1nh \u2014 m\u1ED7i qu\xE1i b\u1ECB gi\u1EEF \u0103n s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng
    t\u0103ng theo s\u1ED1 qu\xE1i b\u1ECB gi\u1EADt + cho\xE1ng 1s (Cu\u1ED3ng N\u1ED9:
    k\xE9o th\xEAm m\u1ECDi qu\xE1i trong t\u1EA7m x\xEDch)."
